From a0cbb8ae0139290ea4d4ff7d811b23d508476ec3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zed-patches <zed-patches@localhost>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:52:58 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] epic_panel: the Epico panel speaks pt-BR

The Epico panel (0066) reads its text through zeo_i18n's t! from
locales/<language>/epic-panel.ftl, in en-US and pt-BR: the empty states, the
live-updates banner, Open EPICO.md, the open-failure notification, Refresh,
the Archived and "more not shown" rows, the row badges and the problem lines
of a row's tooltip. The en-US file is the code's English byte for byte; the
badges select on $problem.

The empty-state lines were &'static str and doubled as the selection's key;
they are SharedString now, still compared by value. Kept as they are: the
panel's name in the dock ("Epico Stories"), the plugin's own words (story,
the type/scale/engineering fields, the statuses) and EPICO.md's name.

In the epic group, after 0066.
---

